// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P269881019" "Dream Doctor's Personal Story"
// tDetailString :
"P2843972940" "Dream Doctor returned to the Midnighter Club to discuss the next action to take with Montague Castanella. Mender Silos interrupted the conversation, demanding to see Dream Doctor in Ouroboros.<br><br>Dream Doctor travelled to Ouroboros, where he informed Mender Silos that he was <i>not</i> the one behind the temporal disturbances. He also revealed that he knew Mender Silos went back in time and tampered with the Dagger of Jocas, shifting it so the weapon would not destroy Rularuu. Silos admitted to this, saying that Rularuu will be needed to destroy the Coming Storm. Dream Doctor walked off, saying that humanity could handle the Coming Storm, and Ouroboros would come crashing down once Battalion was handled."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Marauder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page CleopatraMoralityDead Text :
"P4057266667" "You... {HeroName}... some nerve comin' here. I remember you... the one who told me my girl Cleo was in the Resistance, that she was put down. You see everything here? Look at it...<br><br>The girl who I loved was put down because some guy in a white suit said she was the enemy. I shoulda known it wasn't right, shoulda known better.<br><br>That damn Berry... his super serum took me from a top dog to a pup! Look at me, it's pathetic! I can barely walk without gettin' tired, let alone <i>fight</i>.<br><br>So, what the hell are you doing here? You a rescue squad or somethin'?"
// Answer Text :
"P3333345399" "I'm here on behalf of Marchand. We're getting you out, Praetor White."
// Page RegularPraetorian Text :
"P2844340124" "You... {HeroName}... I remember you. Powers Division... hah... so long ago, back when all that mattered.<br><br>Cleo's dead. She died tryin' to protect me, even admitted that she was in the Resistance this entire time. Not that it mattered. She died fightin' off those monsters, while I stood there like some sorta broken dog!<br><br>That damn Berry... his super serum took me from a top dog to a pup! Look at me, it's pathetic! I can barely walk without gettin' tired, let alone <i>fight</i>.<br><br>So, what the hell are you doing here? You a rescue squad or somethin'?"
// Page RegularLambda Text :
"P4287663246" "You... {HeroName}... I remember you, back in the fight for Lambda sector. Heh... wish I had some of them War Walkers here right about now. Sure would be helpful.<br><br>My girl's dead. She died tryin' to protect me, even admitted that she was in the Resistance this entire time. Not that it mattered. She died fightin' off those monsters, while I stood there like some sorta broken dog!<br><br>That damn Berry... his super serum took me from a top dog to a pup! Look at me, it's pathetic! I can barely walk without gettin' tired, let alone <i>fight</i>.<br><br>So, what the hell are you doing here? You a rescue squad or somethin'?"
// Page Regular Text :
"P3266531923" "You... {HeroName}... I've heard of you. Read up on your files and all your fightin'.<br><br>My girl's dead. She died tryin' to protect me, even admitted that she was in the Resistance this entire time. Not that it mattered. She died fightin' off those monsters, while I stood there like some sorta broken dog!<br><br>That damn Berry... his super serum took me from a top dog to a pup! Look at me, it's pathetic! I can barely walk without gettin' tired, let alone <i>fight</i>.<br><br>So, what the hell are you doing here? You a rescue squad or somethin'?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P1823011055" "<color orange>Praetor White wheezes out a laugh.</color><br><br>I ain't Praetor White, I'm just Marauder now. I shoulda known Marchand would still want me, he was always the one arguin' with big bad Marcus.<br><br>I guess I don't got much of a choice, eh? It's either stay here and become one of these Devoured, or go work with Marchand.<br><br>Suppose I could have worse options, then again, I ain't exactly sure that Primal Earth won't just lock me up in a cell.<br><br>Dammit... to fall so far, {HeroName}! Just... slap me with your fancy teleporter and get me outta here. Let me reflect on my situation when I ain't got a Hamidon staring at me like I'm dinner."
// Answer Text :
"P4005774193" "(Teleport Marauder out)"
// Page Done Text :
"P856364347" ""
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"

