// IntroString :
"P2888098675" "Our first task is to rescue <color yellow>Praetor Michael White</color>. I've had several arguments with members of the Phalanx and Vanguard, but I believe he can be of use. At his heart, White is a good man. He fought for the good of Praetoria and for what he believed in. If he could channel that same power towards <i>good</i>, towards fighting evil like Arachnos, we could show the world that there is hope for anyone.<br><br>Doctor Orts of Vanguard has informed me that they have a location of where Praetor White is, but it isn't good. He's in the outskirts of Imperial City, but he doesn't seem to be moving.<br><br>We need to recover Praetor White before the Devouring Earth find him and make him into one of their own."
// AcceptString :
"P939150519" "Alright, how can I get there?"
// SendOffString :
"P2228670872" "Portal Corp has developed a smaller, more compact portal to use, thanks to the research done by one <color yellow>Emil Christie</color>. You can take the tram to a Vanguard station, where they will get you into one of their portals and to Imperial City.<br><br>I must warn you, {HeroName}, that  you will be going into an <i>extremely</i> dangerous zone. The Hamidon is running rampant there. Vanguard has agreed to send in reinforcements with you, and soldiers loyal to myself have also agreed to provide cover fire for you once you're in.<br><br>Speak with me once you've recovered Praetor White. Marchand out."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2385089781" "Rescue Praetor White"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P629633525" "We must act fast, {HeroName}, we can't keep this portal open for long."
// TaskTitle :
"P2010729112" "<color deepskyblue>One Last Chance</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3412386306" "<color deepskyblue>The Top Dog of Praetoria</color>"

